From 2d129c4a6efc51f170a1be0b286ba2d1f5421fd7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yannick Serafini <yannick.serafini@wifx.net>
Date: Wed, 25 Feb 2026 23:07:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 10/13] usb: gadget: atmel_usba_udc: finalize role-switch
 lifecycle hardening

Complete the role-switch series by finalizing lifecycle ordering across
bind, unbind and remove paths.

Align IRQ, workqueue, clock and PM interactions so teardown and restart
sequences remain deterministic under role transitions.

Ensure UDC state transitions stay coherent when switching roles, stopping
gadget functions and removing the controller.

This closes the remaining gap to the reference target for the UDC files.

Signed-off-by: Yannick Serafini <yannick.serafini@wifx.net>
---
 drivers/usb/gadget/udc/Kconfig          |   5 +
 drivers/usb/gadget/udc/atmel_usba_udc.c | 350 +++++++++++++++++++-----
 drivers/usb/gadget/udc/atmel_usba_udc.h |   3 +
 3 files changed, 294 insertions(+), 64 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/usb/gadget/udc/Kconfig b/drivers/usb/gadget/udc/Kconfig
